Modifications in these independent conversions:
- Reconstructed the original scaled FP8 expert tensors and packed their projections into GGUF expert banks.
- Created mixed Q2_K, Q3_K and Q4_K expert packages with Q8_0 backbone matrices.
- Created a Q4_K expert/backbone package with a Q4_0 text embedding.
- Retained FP16 audio tower and codec weights, folded codec weight normalization and embedded tokenizer/configuration/model-contract resources for native audio.cpp inference.
- Added Q4_K expert/Q8_0 backbone profiles with original routers and shared-expert gates stored as FP32.
- Added a profile that also restores original BF16 text embeddings and the complete BF16 output head.
- Retained the original full-size output-head layout for compatibility with upstream audio.cpp.
- Added audio.cpp resource metadata without changing the trained model architecture.

Conversion and runtime preparation were assisted by Codex (OpenAI).
